    "Result": "Luban and the saw.A long time ago there was a craftsman. His name was Lu bun. One day Lu ban was at work on a mountain. A leaf cut his finger. Lou bun thought how could such a small leaf hurt my finger. He looked at the leaf carefully. There were many teeth on the leaf and the teeth were sharp. Could I make a tool with teeth like these? I could cut things with it easily Li bun said to himself soon Lu ban made a saw. It was the first saw in the world. People are still using this tool today.",
